In view of the proposed rally at Ramleela Ground on 1st November 2026, traffic movement may be regulated and diversions implemented in parts of Central Delhi from 10:00 AM to 5:00 PM.

Commuters are advised to plan their journeys in advance, follow prescribed diversions and cooperate with traffic personnel. Passengers travelling to New Delhi Railway Station are requested to follow the suggested alternative routes.

GENERAL INSTRUCTIONS

* Motorists are requested to avoid affected routes, use public transport, preferably the Metro, and follow traffic instructions.
* Avoid roadside parking and keep roads clear for emergency vehicles.
* For real-time updates and assistance, connect with Delhi Traffic Police through the following channels:

